WEBVTT

00:00:13.970 --> 00:00:16.940
His birthday's coming soon, isn't it?

00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:19.830
I get uneasy every time I look at the calendar.

00:00:21.210 --> 00:00:23.750
But, my husband...

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:26.250
If he has to work, he has to work.

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:29.330
He couldn't make it last year, either.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.330
Franci is always so disappointed.

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:37.970
It'll be fine. I'll make sure of it.

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:43.890
You want one of the cakes you usually get?

00:00:43.890 --> 00:00:48.440
Yes, but give me the largest one you've got.

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:52.610
Sounds like quite the gathering this year. That's fantastic.

00:01:03.130 --> 00:01:06.380
He's turning nine already.

00:01:10.790 --> 00:01:12.900
I'm going to make it a fun day.

00:02:46.130 --> 00:02:51.510
A Special Day

00:02:47.440 --> 00:02:54.170
<i>This mysterious restaurant is on a road just a little ways from the center of Rome.</i>

00:02:57.400 --> 00:03:00.800
This is great. I've always wanted the three of us to drink together.

00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:05.770
And, I had no idea that Luciano had such a lovely daughter.

00:03:05.770 --> 00:03:09.550
I thought about introducing myself to you.

00:03:09.550 --> 00:03:12.180
Papa told me so much about you, Nicoletta.

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:17.270
He probably said things like, "This newbie who just barged in one day," huh?

00:03:18.410 --> 00:03:22.090
He means well when he says those things, though. Please forgive him.

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:24.270
Means well, huh?

00:03:28.340 --> 00:03:31.530
All right, since we're off tomorrow, let's get another bottle!

00:03:31.530 --> 00:03:34.160
I'm can't, I have a date tonight.

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:35.370
Where you headed?

00:03:35.370 --> 00:03:38.840
We're just going to jog home together.

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:41.710
You guys are like two peas in a pod.

00:03:43.620 --> 00:03:45.310
<i>A date, huh?</i>

00:03:45.310 --> 00:03:47.660
<i>I want to go on a date someday.</i>

00:03:49.350 --> 00:03:51.480
I should get going too.

00:03:51.480 --> 00:03:52.600
What?

00:03:52.600 --> 00:03:54.990
It's Franci's birthday tomorrow.

00:03:54.990 --> 00:03:56.460
I've got to prepare.

00:03:56.700 --> 00:03:58.780
Oh, I had no idea!

00:03:58.780 --> 00:03:59.930
Congrats!

00:04:00.350 --> 00:04:02.200
Nonno is going all out.

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:08.200
Since my husband can't make it, he's working extra hard on the festivities.

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:13.960
That's a side of him that he'll never show us.

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:16.200
I'd like to see it, though.

00:04:17.110 --> 00:04:19.870
Say, would you mind if I stopped by?

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:22.350
I'd love for you to come!

00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:25.130
But are you sure you'd want to use your day off for that?

00:04:25.130 --> 00:04:27.980
Sure! How about you, Marina?

00:04:28.360 --> 00:04:31.010
If you're OK with an adult guest coming...

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:34.020
Splendid. Franci will be so happy.

00:04:36.570 --> 00:04:40.560
<i>Oh, but we can't tell Luciano...</i>

00:04:41.620 --> 00:04:42.710
Good night.

00:04:42.710 --> 00:04:43.480
Ciao.

00:04:43.480 --> 00:04:46.330
Ciao, Luciano, Margherita.

00:04:43.480 --> 00:04:46.330
Ciao, Margherita, Nicoletta.

00:04:51.860 --> 00:04:58.160
So... We can make it a real surprise party for Luciano.

00:04:58.160 --> 00:04:59.140
What do you say?

00:04:59.910 --> 00:05:02.600
Luciano will be totally surprised.

00:05:02.600 --> 00:05:04.570
Sure, sounds like fun.

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:07.920
I'm all for it, of course.

00:05:08.970 --> 00:05:10.250
And you, Teo?

00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:12.950
My plans fell apart, so since I'm free...

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:14.130
Gigi?

00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:19.000
So it's a yes from you, too.

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:20.410
Thanks, everyone!

00:05:20.690 --> 00:05:23.340
You've really gotten to know us well, Nicoletta.

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:29.590
The fact you can understand what Gigi is thinking means you've matured as an apprentice.

00:05:30.040 --> 00:05:31.720
Is that a good thing?

00:05:34.340 --> 00:05:36.820
Papa came back to get something he forgot.

00:05:36.820 --> 00:05:39.610
I think I left it on top of Teo's motorcycle.

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:41.620
There it is.

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:45.610
I know you've all got the day off, but don't go drinking yourselves silly now.

00:05:45.610 --> 00:05:49.610
Oh, do you have any particular plans tomorrow, Luciano?

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:51.510
It's a secret.

00:05:53.990 --> 00:05:56.610
Then so are my plans.

00:05:59.550 --> 00:06:01.550
Good night.

00:06:03.450 --> 00:06:05.570
Thanks for walking me home.

00:06:05.570 --> 00:06:08.190
I'll try to get there early tomorrow.

00:06:08.970 --> 00:06:12.070
Francesco's friends will be arriving around five, right?

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:16.270
So I'll try to get there around three...

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:20.530
I'm sorry, Papa! I'm doing something in the afternoon.

00:06:20.530 --> 00:06:20.980
Huh?

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:23.350
Can you come at around five, too?

00:06:23.350 --> 00:06:25.460
At five? But then...

00:06:25.460 --> 00:06:28.480
I can take care of the preparations by myself. I'll be fine.

00:06:28.480 --> 00:06:29.840
You're on cake duty.

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:31.470
Don't be late.

00:06:31.470 --> 00:06:33.510
I'm counting on you. Good night!

00:06:33.510 --> 00:06:34.610
Ciao.

00:06:48.870 --> 00:06:50.050
Look at this!

00:06:50.450 --> 00:06:55.080
Nice. Do you think this will be OK here?

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:57.630
Yeah, it looks great.

00:06:57.630 --> 00:06:59.540
So, how many people are we expecting?

00:06:59.540 --> 00:07:03.330
Fifteen, if you count the adult guests.

00:07:03.330 --> 00:07:06.930
Did you hear that? Can you handle all that by yourself?

00:07:07.620 --> 00:07:11.040
Wanna have a contest? See who has the larger lung capacity?

00:07:16.420 --> 00:07:17.800
Holy cow.

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:27.920
So Franci likes pizza, huh?

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:31.240
Yup, he'd eat it for breakfast, lunch, and dinner, if he could.

00:07:31.240 --> 00:07:32.840
All right, ready to do this?

00:07:33.350 --> 00:07:34.600
Yeah.

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:36.900
Oh, what about Gigi?

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:45.450
He's doing a... juice tasting?

00:07:59.240 --> 00:08:01.560
That's too boring.

00:08:08.870 --> 00:08:11.770
He'd like it, but he won't be surprised by it.

00:08:16.190 --> 00:08:18.120
Welcome home, Franci.

00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:19.740
Welcome back.

00:08:19.740 --> 00:08:22.200
Oh, the birthday boy is here!

00:08:24.610 --> 00:08:26.420
Want me to help with something?

00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:28.980
The birthday boy shouldn't work.

00:08:28.980 --> 00:08:30.750
OK, Mamma.

00:08:38.500 --> 00:08:40.380
I'll carry that!

00:08:40.380 --> 00:08:42.180
Be careful. It's hot.

00:08:42.180 --> 00:08:43.920
They look so good...

00:08:45.990 --> 00:08:47.040
Ow!

00:08:48.700 --> 00:08:50.970
Are you all right, Franci?

00:08:51.650 --> 00:08:52.770
The cookies...

00:08:52.770 --> 00:08:53.850
Oh, thank heavens.

00:08:53.850 --> 00:08:55.300
What'll I do with you, Franci?

00:08:55.730 --> 00:09:00.430
Teo's got more cookies in the oven, so don't worry about it.

00:09:09.700 --> 00:09:11.100
Franci...

00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:21.930
It's so nice out.

00:09:22.810 --> 00:09:25.680
It's supposed to get chilly tonight, though.

00:09:30.180 --> 00:09:31.700
Wow, it's so cute.

00:09:31.700 --> 00:09:33.820
It'd look good on you, Nicoletta.

00:09:33.820 --> 00:09:35.820
You think so?

00:09:35.820 --> 00:09:38.810
Oh, that one would look good on you, Claudio.

00:09:39.150 --> 00:09:41.170
Oh, that's my favorite color.

00:09:41.170 --> 00:09:42.250
Seriously?

00:09:42.250 --> 00:09:43.210
Yeah.

00:09:49.170 --> 00:09:52.310
<i>This kinda feels like a date.</i>

00:10:02.190 --> 00:10:04.300
Well, should we get going?

00:10:05.020 --> 00:10:06.650
Oh... Sure.

00:10:32.300 --> 00:10:33.500
Grazie.

00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:34.880
Prego.

00:10:40.040 --> 00:10:42.250
We don't have to go back yet?

00:10:42.660 --> 00:10:47.250
Nah, we can kill a little more time around here first.

00:10:47.760 --> 00:10:51.830
Leave the party preparation to the common folk.

00:10:51.830 --> 00:10:54.550
Today is the prince's birthday celebration!

00:10:55.420 --> 00:10:57.910
But keep it secret from Nonno.

00:10:58.550 --> 00:11:00.560
Exactly. Secret.

00:11:34.060 --> 00:11:35.080
Move!

00:11:47.470 --> 00:11:48.610
What?

00:11:54.700 --> 00:11:57.090
What was that all about, Claudio?

00:11:57.090 --> 00:11:59.840
Shh. Over there.

00:12:04.290 --> 00:12:04.980
Huh?

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:17.770
Franci, stay in there!

00:12:17.770 --> 00:12:18.920
Franci!

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:30.230
Nicoletta, move further in.

00:13:00.620 --> 00:13:02.480
By the skin of our teeth.

00:13:07.250 --> 00:13:10.300
Oh, right. I'll pick up the cake.

00:13:19.680 --> 00:13:22.150
Then so are my plans.

00:13:23.390 --> 00:13:24.860
Oh, I see.

00:13:33.420 --> 00:13:38.430
Hey, bro, isn't today Franci's festa? Shouldn't you be going?

00:13:38.910 --> 00:13:41.650
I was just stopping by for a bit.

00:13:42.070 --> 00:13:45.880
Oh, then please give Franci my present.

00:13:45.880 --> 00:13:49.640
And tell him I apologize for not being able to take off work.

00:13:50.040 --> 00:13:51.180
OK.

00:13:52.520 --> 00:13:56.530
Our secret plan was almost exposed.

00:13:56.530 --> 00:13:58.940
It's a good thing he didn't spot us.

00:13:59.380 --> 00:14:02.390
Why did Luciano go into that shop?

00:14:02.390 --> 00:14:05.380
Nonna loved that bakery.

00:14:05.380 --> 00:14:06.710
Nonna?

00:14:07.070 --> 00:14:09.470
His late wife.

00:14:09.470 --> 00:14:11.030
Oh, I see.

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:14.950
So, she liked that cake... What was she like?

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:17.950
She was beautiful. But we never met.

00:14:18.390 --> 00:14:19.440
Hmm?

00:14:19.440 --> 00:14:22.780
There are pictures of her in Luciano's house.

00:14:22.780 --> 00:14:25.490
She had a radiant smile.

00:14:25.790 --> 00:14:28.460
Nonno is always looking at photos of her.

00:14:28.810 --> 00:14:30.000
I see.

00:14:31.790 --> 00:14:35.730
<i>Till death do us part... huh?</i>

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:47.210
She used to always ask for a large cake because it was a "special occasion."

00:14:47.210 --> 00:14:50.330
Festivals, weddings, birthdays...

00:14:50.840 --> 00:14:56.300
She would just make them up so she could eat it.

00:14:56.900 --> 00:15:01.620
Well, congratulations on your grandson turning nine.

00:15:02.430 --> 00:15:03.620
Grazie.

00:15:05.350 --> 00:15:07.060
Wow!

00:15:07.500 --> 00:15:09.760
Is everything to your liking, young prince?

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:11.300
Yeah!

00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:13.660
Come now, let's get you changed.

00:15:13.660 --> 00:15:15.140
Sure, Mamma.

00:15:18.840 --> 00:15:21.280
Buonasera!

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:23.900
Buonasera.

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:25.590
Welcome.

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:28.400
We got here a little early.

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:30.040
Welcome.

00:15:31.000 --> 00:15:32.530
Buonasera.

00:15:32.930 --> 00:15:38.100
Have a seat. I'll bring you something to drink.

00:15:47.120 --> 00:15:49.130
Grazie.

00:15:50.290 --> 00:15:52.350
You have so many butlers.

00:15:52.350 --> 00:15:55.920
They're friends of Nonno. They're just helping out today.

00:15:57.860 --> 00:16:00.580
It smells so good!

00:16:06.490 --> 00:16:09.310
Buonasera. We've been expecting you.

00:16:09.590 --> 00:16:10.700
Nonna!

00:16:22.550 --> 00:16:25.080
I'll be on camera duty.

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:26.540
I'll take care of the video.

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:27.980
Thanks, guys.

00:16:29.090 --> 00:16:30.940
Oh, it's Papa.

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:37.200
Buonasera, Luciano.

00:16:37.200 --> 00:16:38.650
That's the cake, isn't it?

00:16:38.650 --> 00:16:40.440
I'll take it for you.

00:16:40.740 --> 00:16:43.100
Buonasera, Luciano.

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:46.250
Please, allow me to take your things.

00:16:46.760 --> 00:16:48.700
Buonasera, Papa.

00:16:49.370 --> 00:16:51.570
You were the ones that plotted this, weren't you?

00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:54.120
I'd prefer if you said "planned".

00:16:59.670 --> 00:17:00.740
Nonno!

00:17:02.400 --> 00:17:05.580
This is a present from your uncle.

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:07.520
I'll have to go say thanks later.

00:17:23.050 --> 00:17:25.780
Buon compleanno!

00:17:26.040 --> 00:17:28.510
Happy birthday, Francesco!

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:40.710
It's delicious.

00:17:41.890 --> 00:17:44.550
This is awesome, Franci.

00:17:45.520 --> 00:17:47.400
What a great festa.

00:17:47.800 --> 00:17:48.800
Yeah.

00:17:52.580 --> 00:17:56.940
Tanti auguri a te,

00:17:56.940 --> 00:18:01.160
tanti auguri a te...

00:18:01.160 --> 00:18:07.080
Tanti auguri, Francesco.

00:18:07.080 --> 00:18:13.180
Tanti auguri a te!

00:18:16.430 --> 00:18:18.900
Blow out the candles, Franci!

00:18:34.820 --> 00:18:38.800
Sorry, guys. Just wait a little bit longer.

00:18:42.590 --> 00:18:43.650
All yours.

00:18:43.650 --> 00:18:45.040
You got it.

00:18:55.710 --> 00:18:58.170
It's Teo's special dolce plate!

00:19:01.010 --> 00:19:02.560
It's so pretty!

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:04.980
The dolce looks fantastic.

00:19:04.980 --> 00:19:06.410
Incredible!

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:08.060
It's so good.

00:19:14.220 --> 00:19:16.210
You've done enough. Go take a break.

00:19:16.630 --> 00:19:17.770
Very well.

00:19:17.770 --> 00:19:19.830
We shall do just that.

00:19:25.440 --> 00:19:26.820
Grazie.

00:20:04.940 --> 00:20:06.640
Nicoletta?

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:09.400
I just needed some fresh air to sober up.

00:20:10.350 --> 00:20:13.650
Umm, this afternoon...

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:17.660
The party turned out pretty nice, didn't it?

00:20:17.660 --> 00:20:19.510
It sure did.

00:20:26.220 --> 00:20:27.600
Franci.

00:20:29.030 --> 00:20:30.260
Mamma.

00:20:30.620 --> 00:20:31.710
Having a good time?

00:20:31.710 --> 00:20:32.550
Yeah.

00:20:32.910 --> 00:20:35.840
It's because Nonno works in that restaurant.

00:20:35.840 --> 00:20:37.770
Yeah, you're right.

00:20:48.440 --> 00:20:50.520
Grazie, Nonno.

00:20:58.590 --> 00:21:15.940
Day of Yore

00:20:59.390 --> 00:21:00.450
Hey.

00:21:04.970 --> 00:21:06.560
Eat it.

00:22:54.940 --> 00:22:59.340
Hey... Watch it!
